WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.428 --> 00:00:04.117
Unit eight. Opening and Closing Apps!

2
00:00:05.027 --> 00:00:09.584
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:12.501
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.551 --> 00:00:16.561
Today we learn about Opening and Closing Apps. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.932 --> 00:00:21.693
Open. Say it with me. Open!

6
00:00:25.205 --> 00:00:29.172
Close. Say it with me. Close!

7
00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:37.212
App switcher. Say it with me. App switcher!

8
00:00:40.718 --> 00:00:44.781
Minimize. Say it with me. Minimize!

9
00:00:48.285 --> 00:00:52.252
Exit. Say it with me. Exit!

10
00:00:55.710 --> 00:00:59.943
Background. Say it with me. Background!

11
00:01:03.486 --> 00:01:07.410
Running. Say it with me. Running!

12
00:01:10.906 --> 00:01:15.555
Multitask. Say it with me. Multitask!

13
00:01:19.053 --> 00:01:28.056
I open an app by tapping its icon. I close an app by exiting or using the app switcher. Some apps run in the background.

14
00:01:28.106 --> 00:01:31.165
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:31.867 --> 00:01:37.181
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:37.231 --> 00:01:38.522
App switcher!

17
00:01:39.614 --> 00:01:45.053
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:45.103 --> 00:01:46.253
Running!

19
00:01:47.154 --> 00:01:53.517
Did you know? Closing apps you aren't using can sometimes help your device's battery last longer!

20
00:01:53.567 --> 00:01:55.770
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:56.858 --> 00:02:05.662
Think and answer. Why might you close an app when you're done using it?

22
00:02:05.712 --> 00:02:06.862
Great answer!

23
00:02:07.851 --> 00:02:13.904
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:13.954 --> 00:02:17.268
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

